<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
<p>LATE REPORTED SALES THAT TOOK PLACE IN APRIL.</p>
<p>TANKERS.</p>
<p>Merity - (built 1983) 24,000 dwt sold for $14.1 million.</p>
<p>Sea Mawson - (built 1972) 24,489 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $2.4 million.</p>
<p>Nord Sea Asiatic - (built 1997) 29,500 dwt sold to Portuguese buyers for $27.5 million.</p>
<p>Westernport - (built 1977) 67,840 dwt sold for $21.8 million.</p>
<p>CONTAINER VESSELS.</p>
<p>Lukas - (built 1994) 12,700 dwt sold for $23.5 million.</p>
<p>CMBT Ensign - (built 1979) 18,002 dwt sold for $5.2 million.</p>
<p>Jan Ritscher - (built 1997) 22,900 dwt sold for $30.7 million.</p>
<p>Wiking - (built 1997) 22,900 dwt sold for $30.7 million.</p>
